tantra2 lookup-word

-- find the knowledge graph node for a surface word form.
-- 1. word-node  — abbreviation/alias mappings (kg→kilogram, N→newton, what→prashna)
-- 2. lookup     — exact graph node by name (mass, velocity, force, ...)
-- 3. try-morpheme-rules — suffix inversion for plurals (velocities→velocity)

takes word

abbrev = word-node word
ex     = (cond (exists abbrev) _none otherwise (lookup word))

result = (cond (exists abbrev) abbrev
  otherwise (cond (exists ex) ex
  otherwise (try-morpheme-rules word)))

return result

done
